name: sim.getPropertiesInfos
description: Convenience function to fetches all properties infos of a specific target item
luaSynopsis: dict propertiesInfo = sim.getPropertiesInfos(int target, dict options = {})
pythonSynopsis: map propertiesInfo = sim.getPropertiesInfos(int target, map options = {})
inputs:
1. target: target item
2. options: an optional map
outputs:
1. propertiesInfo: properties infos
